<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Ibraawe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibraawe Asaas Xaafettida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibraawe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ibraawe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafettida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hayssi ha kiitazi xaafettiday istta bolla gakkida gita metoza gaason ba ammano agganaas matida ammaniza asaa gishshassa. Hayssa xaafidaadey Ibraaweppe ammanidaytas Yesus Kirstoosi tumanne wurseththan Xoossi asa naas qonccisiday Xoossa Nay iza gididayssa bessanaassa; ha ammanizayti ba ammanon minni eqqana mala izi istta minththeththees; hessika tumu gididayssa heedzdzu tuma yo7ota qonccisi bessees.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Ba ekkida metoza baggara ba Aawaas tumappe azazettizaade gidida gishshas kase Gal7a Caaqo Maxaafan diza nabetappe, Museppenne kiitanchchatappeka keehi aadhdhees.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Yesusi kase Gal7a Caaqo wode qeesetappeka keehi aadhdhiza mernaa qeesey iza gididayssa Xoossi ba doonan yootides.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Ammanizaadey nagarappe, baboppenne hayqoppe Yesusa baggara attana; Yesusi qeeseta halaqa gidida mala Ibraaweta ammano wogatinne meheta yarshoy coo eesho mala gidida atoteththay izi tumu gidana mala ooththides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafaa xaafidaadey Isra7eele nayta taariken erettida asata ammano leemiso go7ettidi (shempo 11) nababiza asay ammanon minnana mala qofsees. Hessaththoka (shempo 12) bolla nababiza asay ba ayfe Yesusa bolla lo7eththi woththidi ammanon minnana malanne ay metoynne waayeykka istta bolla gakkikokka dandayana mala zorees. Wurseththankka izi isttas dumma dumma zorenne seera qaala imon kuuyees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso, Xoossi bana Kirstoosa baggara qonccisides <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosi kiitanchchatappe bolla gideth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosi Museppenne Iyaasoppe bollateth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa qeeseteth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa caaqo qaalaa bollateth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1—9:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa yarsheteththa bollateth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano bayrateth <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossaa ufaysso <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurseththa woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ba Naaza Baggara Xoossi Yootida Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Beni wodeppe oykkidi Xoossi dumma dumma ogera nabeta baggara kase nu Aawatas daro wode yootides. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Qasse hayssa wurseththa wode bolla wursi laatissidaadenne ha alameza medhdhida ba naaza baggara nuus yootides. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Izikka Xoossa bonchcho bessizaadenne Xoossa Xoossateththaas lo7o leemiso gididi ba wolqqama qaalan wursika shiishshi oykkides; izi asaa nagarappe geeshshidaappe guye salon bonchcho Xoossaa ushachchan uttides.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiitanchchatappe Xoossa Naa Aadheth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Hessa gishshas izas imettida sunththay kiitanchchata sunththaafe aadhdhizayssa mala izikka kiitanchchatappe keehi aadhdhees. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Xoossi kiitanchchafe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Neni ta naa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ta nena hach yeladis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Woykko ta izas Aawaa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">izikka ta naa gidana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">oonas gidee?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Qasseka Xoossi ba bayra Naaza duge ha biittaa bolla yeddishe, «Xoossa kiitanchchati wurikka izas goynnetto» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Zaare 32:43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Kiitanchchata gishshas haasayshe qasse, «Kiitanchchata ayanata; ba oosanchchatakka tama laco kessees» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Maza 104:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Naaza gishshas qasse, «Godoo! Ne zufaaney mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas minni daana; neni ne kawoteththaa likke kaaleththaasa. <verse eid="HEB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Neni xilloteth dosadasa; makkallaka ixxaasa; hessa gishshas Xoossi ne Goday nena ne laggetappe bolla kessides; nena ufayssa zayte tiydes» gees. <verse eid="HEB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Qasse, «Godoo! Koyro neni biitta medhdhadasa; Salotikka ne kushen oosettida. <verse eid="HEB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Istti dhayana; neni gidikko minna daana; istti wurikka may7o mala gal7ana. <verse eid="HEB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Neni istta may7o mala qalam7ana; isttika may7o mala laamettana; ne gidikko aydekka neni nena; ne duussas wurseththi deenna» gees. <verse eid="HEB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Xoossi kiitanchchatappe, «Tani ne morkketa ne toho garsan yedhisana gakkanaas ne ta ushachchan utta» oona gidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maza 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Kiitanchchati wurikka atoteth laattana asata ooththanaas Xoossafe kiitettiza oosanchcha Ayana gidettennee?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gita Maaroteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Hessa gishshas nuni siyida qaalaappe balettidi kundontta mala nu siyida qaalaa lo7eththi naaganaas bessees. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Aazas giikko kase kiitanchchata baggara yootettida qaalay tumu gidida he qaalaa yedhdhi aadhdhiday baas bessiza qixaate ekkees. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Nu qasse hessa mala gita maaroteth coo leppi histtiko waani attanee? Hayssi maaroteththay koyro Godaa baggara nuus yootettides; izappe siyidaytikka nuus geeshshi yootida. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Xoossi qasseka malaatata, malalisiza miishshata, dumma dumma malaatata oosoninne ba shene mala immida Xillo Ayana imotata baggara istta markkateththaa minththides.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Zereth Ashshiday Yesusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Xoossi hayssa nu iza gishshas haasayza buro yaana alameza kiitanchchas haarisibeenna. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Gido attiin Geeshsha Maxaafay harason,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Ne izas yuushsha qoppanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">asi aazee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Izas ne qoppanaas asa nay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">izi aazee?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ne iza kiitanchchatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">guuththara guuththadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Bonchcho zawudenne galata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">iza hu7en woththadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Neni iza ne kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">oosota bolla shuumadasa.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Ne wursaka iza toho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">garsan haarisadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">Xoossi ubbaaka izappe garsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">izas haarisishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">attiday ay miishshika deenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">Gido attiin ha7i qasse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">wurikka izas haarettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">nu beyibeekko» gides.<verse eid="HEB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Gido attiin Xoossa kiyateththan asa ubbaa gishshas hayqqanaas kiitanchchatappe guuththa wode guuxxida Yesusi waaye hayqo hayqqidi ha7i bonchchonne galata zawude ba hu7en woththidayssa nu beyoos. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Hanizay wurikka izappe izas medhettida Xoossi daro nayta bonchchos efanaas istta maaroteththas hu7e gidida Yesusi waayen polanaas koshshizaaz gidides.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />As geeshshizaynne izan geeyza asay heyti issi keeththa asata. Hessa gishshas Yesusi istta, «Ta ishatoo» gi xeyganaas yeellatenna. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />«Tani ne sunththan ta ishatas yootana shiiqida dereza sinththan nena galatiza mazamure ta yexxana.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Maza 22:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Hessaththoka, «Ta izan ammanettana» qasseka, «Taninne taas Xoossi immida nayti nu haan doos» gees Geeshsha Maxaafay.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa 8:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Naytas ashoynne suuththi diza mala izikka istta mala asa; hessika hayqo bolla izas wolqqay diza daabulosa izi ba hayqo wolqqan zaaranaassa. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Hessaththoka ba diza wode ubbaan hayqos babon haaretti qashettidayta hayqoppe wozzanaassa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Izi haa yiday kiitanchchata maaddanaas gidontta Abrahaame zereththata maaddanaas yides. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Hessa gishshas ubba baggara izi ba ishata misatanaas bessizaade gidides; izi hessa ooththiday maarizaadenne ammanettida waanna qeese halaqa gididi Xoossas ooththanaassinne dereza nagarappe maaranaassa. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Izi ba hu7en paacettidi meto ekkida gishshas paacettizayta maaddanaas dandayees.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Museppe Aadhdhees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Hessa gishshas saloppe xeyssi inttena gakkiin ammaniza nu ishatoo! Nu ammanos Hawaarenne qeeseta halaqa gidida Yesusa qopite. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Musey Xoossa Keeth ubbaa bolla ammanettidaade gidida mala Yesusikka bana shuumidaades ammanettidaade. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Keeththe keexxidaades keeththaafe bollara bonchchoy diza mala Yesusaska Museppe aadhdhiza bonchchoy bessizaade gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Keeththe ubbaasikka keexxidaadey dees; gido attiin wursika ooththiday Xoossa. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musey tinbite markkattishe Xoossa Keeth ubba bolla issi ammanettida oosanchcha mala gidi de7ides. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Kirstoosi gidikko Xoossa Keeththaa bolla ammanettida naa mala. Nunikka iza bolla ammanettiza ufayssaynne ceeqettiza hidotaa lo7eththi oykkiko nu izas duussa keeththa.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Asas Imettida Qofiso Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Hessa gishshas Xillo Ayanay giza mala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Intte hach iza qaala siyikko<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Maza 95:7-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />bazzo biittan intte tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">paaccida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">makkallidayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">intte wozina muumisopite.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Intte aawati kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">heen tana paaccidanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">tanara eqettida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">Ta ooththidayssa wursi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">oyddu tammu layth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">gakkanaas be7ida.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />He wode yeletata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ta hanqettin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">istta wozinay ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">balettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">istti ta oge eribeettenna.<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Qasse, ‹Ta isttas immiza shemposo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">istti mulekka gelettenna!›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:11">gaada tani ta hanqon caaqqadis» gees.<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ta ishatoo! Inttefe oonikka de7o Xoossaafe haraso inttena haassiza iitanne ammanontta wozinay dontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Harappeka intte garsafe oonikka nagaran balettidi ba wozina muumisontta mala, «Hach» geetettishin hach hach intte intte garsan minettite. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Nuus kase koyroppe diza ammano nuni wurseth gakkanaas lo7eththi minththi oykkiko nuni Kirstoosara issife laattana.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Hessika, «Intte hach iza qaalaa siyikko kase makkallidaytayssa mala ha7ikka intte wozina intte minththontta mala» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssaththo hanides.<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Siyidi makkallidayti istti oonanttee? Musey Gibxeppe kaaleththi kessidayta ubbata gidettennee? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Xoossi istta bolla oyddu tammu layth hanqettidayti istti oonanttee? Nagara ooththiin istta ahay bazzo biittan kundi attidayta gidettennee? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Izas azazettontta ixxidaytappe attiin iza shemposo gelontta mala izi caaqqi diggiday haray oonanttee? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Hessa gishshas istti gelontta attiday ammanoy baynda gishshas gididayssa nu eroos.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Deres Imettida Sambata Shempo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Gede shemposo gelanaas imettida hidotay ha7ikka naagetti diza gishshas intte giddofe oonikka hessas bessonttaade gidontta mala ane naagettoos. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Heytanttas sabbakettida mala nuuska mishiraachcho qaalay sabbakettides; gidikkoka siyida asatara siyida qaalay isttara ammanon walakettontta aggida gishshas istta go7ibeenna. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Nu qasse ammanizayti he shemposoza gelana. Xoossi, «Hessa gishshas tani ta hanqon, ‹Ta isttas immana gida shemposoza istti mulekka gelettenna› gaada ta caaqqadis» gides. Gido attiin hayssi alamey medhettoosoppe haa simmiin iza oosoy polettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maza 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Issi sohon laappunththa gallassa gishshas, «Laappunththa gallassi Xoossi ooso ubbaafe shempides» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafaan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Qasseka he sozan, «Tumappe istti ta shemposo mulekka gelettenna» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maza 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Iza shemposo buro gelana issi issi asati deettes; kase isttas mishiraachcho qaalay sabbakettidayti azazettontta ixxida gishshas iza shemposo istti gelibeettenna. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Hessa gishshas Xoossi, «Hach» giidi qasseka hara gallas woththides; hessika daro layththatappe guye Dawite baggara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Hach intte iza qaalaa siyikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">intte wozinaa muumisopite»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">geetetti kase yootettida mala hanides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maza 95:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Iyaasoy isttas shempo immidaakko Xoossi hara gallas giidi yootennakoshin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Zaare 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Iya 22:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Hessa gishshas Sambata gallas shempoy Xoossa deres ha7ikka dees. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Gaasoykka Xoossa shemposo gelizay wuri Xoossi ooththi shempida mala izikka ba oosoppe shempana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Hessa gishshas oonikka heytantta mala azazettontta ixxidayssa leemiso kaallidi kundontta mala he shemposoyo gelanaas ane minnoos.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Xoossa qaalay paxa dizayssanne ooththiza qaala; nam7u bagga qara mashshafekka aadhdhi qara; shempponne ayana, shayanne koldzeka shaakkana gakkanaas caddees; wozina qofaanne amoteththaaka paacci xeellees. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Xoossa ayfeppe geemettida medhetay mulekka deenna; nu izas nu gishshas zaaro immanaas bessiza iza sinththan hanoy wurikka kallo qonccen beettana.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta Halaqa Yesusa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Hessa gishshas pude salo bida qeeseta halaqa Xoossa Naa Yesusi nuus diza gishshas ane nuni nu ammano ane minththi oykkoos. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Nu daaburshin nuus qadhettana dandayza qeeseta halaqay nuus dees; izi nu mala ubba miishshan paacettides; gidikkoka izi aykko nagarakka ooththibeenna. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Hessa gishshas nuni maaroteth ekkanaassinne nuna koshshiza wode nuna maaddiza iza kiyateth nu demmana mala gede iza maaroteththa algaakko ane ammanon shiiqos.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Qeeseta halaqa gidi shuumettizaadey daro asaa giddofe dooretteessinne asa gishshas gididi imotanne nagara gishshas yarsho shiishshanaas doorettees. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Izikka ba baggara daaburanchcha gidida gishshas erontta asatassinne oge balidaytas qadhettana dandayees. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Izi ba nagara gishshassinne hara asata nagara gishshas yarsho shiishshanaas izas bessizay hessa gishshassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lewe 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Aarooney xeygettidayssaththo izi Xoossi xeygidaade gidanaas bessees attiin hessa he bonchchoza barkka baas ekkizaadey deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kessa 28:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Hessaththoka Kirstoosi qeeseta halaqa gidana bonchcho barkka baas ekkibeenna; gido attiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">«Ne ta naakko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">ta nees hach Aawaa gidadis»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">gida Xoossaafe ekkides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maza 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Hessaththoka harason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">«Malkexeedeqe shuumeta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">neni mernaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">qeeseta halaqa» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maza 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesusi hayssa biittaa bolla diza wode iza hayqoppe ashshana dandayzayssako afunxxishe qaala dhoqqu histti woossides. Addafe ashketeththara izi azazettida gishshas iza woosaakka Xoossi siyides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mato 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luqa 22:39-46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Izi Xoossa Naa gidikkoka ba ekkida waayezappe azazeteth tamaardes. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Hessa baggara pacey bayndaade gidi beettidayssafe guye baas azazettizaytas ubbaas mernaa atoteththas gaaso gidides. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Malkexeedeqe shuumeteththaa mala qeeseta halaqa geetetti Xoossan shuumettides.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanon Minnana Mala Imettida Qofiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Hessa gishshas nu haasayana miishshi buro daroy dees; gido attiin intte dotta7ata gidida gishshas inttena erisoy meto. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Intte hanni wode astamaare gidanaas bessishin Xoossa qaalaa buro koyroppe denththidi inttena tamaarsiza as inttes koshshees. Inttes mino kath gidontta maath koshshees. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Maath paahettizay qii guuththa naa gidiza gishshas lo7onne iita shaakkiza timirte shaakki erenna. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Mino kaththi gidikko lo7onne iita shaakki eranaas dandayza wozina kunththida asatassa.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Hessa gishshas koyroppe Kirstoosa gishshas imettida timirteza aggidi ane gede mino timirtekko boos. Hayqqida oosoppe maaroteththan gelo gishshassinne Xoossan ammano gishshas ane izan buro wodhdhi maadhdhoko. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Hessaththoka xinqata gishshassinne kushe asa bolla wotho gishshas qasseka hayqqidayta denththaa gishshassinne mernaa pirda gishshas buro woththi doommoko. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Xoossa shene gidikko nu hessaththo ooththana.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Ba ammano kaddida asata istta maaroteththan wostti zoranee? He asati poo7oy isttas issito poo7idayta salo imoteththaa ekki be7idayta, Xillo Ayana ekki be7idayta, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Xoossaa lo7o qaalanne buro yaana alameza wolqqa ekki be7idayta, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />zaari kaddidayta, istta nam7anththo zaari maaroteththan ekoy dandayettenna; gaasoykka istti ba mooros Xoossa Naa zaari kaqqeettessinne kawushsheettes.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Ubba wode ira uyiza biittaya qasseka iza goyizaades ayfe immiza biittaya Xoossa achchan anjjettadus. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Gido attiin agunththinne odoroy mokkiza biittaya go7ay bayndaaro gidana; he biittays qanggeteththi matan dees; izi wurseththi taman xuugeteth gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Medhe 3:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ta ishatoo! Nuni hessaththo haasaykkoka inttes intte atoteththara oykettida lo7o miishshi dizayssa nu sidhokko. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Kase gidiin woykko ha7i gidiinkka intte ammanizayta maaddidayssanne iza sunththaa gishshas intte bessida siiqoteththaa balanaas Xoossi makkallanchcha gidenna. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Inttes imettida hidotay polettana gakkanaas inttefe issi issi asi hessa mala ooso wurseth gakkanaas genccidi ooththana mala nu amottoos. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ammanoninne dandayan intte iza hidota qaalaa laattizayta misatanaappe attiin dotta7ata gidanayssa nu koyokko.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Immida Hidota Qaala Tumateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13-14" />Xoossi Abrahaames hidota immida wode caaqqishe hara izappe aadhdhizaadey baynda gishshas barkka banan, «Ta nena tumappe anjjana; tani ne zereth darsana» gi caaqqides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Medhe 22:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abrahaameykka gencci naagidaappe kaallidi izas imettida hidota demmides.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Asay caaqo caaqqishe baappe dhoqqan caaqqees; Caaqozikka geetettidayssi polettana mala minththiza gishshas caaqqidayta giddon palamay dendiko kase caaqo qaalay diggees. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Xoossi laamettontta ba qofaa hidota qaalaa laattanaytas qonccisana mala koyida gishshas caaqo qaalan minththides. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Xoossi ay wodekka wordotanaas dandayenna; izi laamettontta nam7u miishshatan nu sinththan diza hidotaa oykkanaas izakko shiiqida nuni gita minoteth demmana mala ooththides. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Nunikka shempo teqe gidida minonne ammanththiza hidota demmidos; he hidotaykka magalashazappe guye baggara diza gede Xoossa Keeththaa gido gelees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magalasha gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththon qaalan magaraja geettes.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lewe 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />He soozikka nu gishshas Yesusi kaseti gelidaso; izikka Malkexeedeqe shuumeteththaa mala mernaas qeeseta halaqa gidides.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta Halaqa Malkexeedeqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Hessi Malkexeedeqey Saaleme kawonne Xoossa qeese; izikka Abrahaamey kawota oli xoonidi simmishin demmidi Abrahaame anjjides. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Abrahaameykka baas diza ubbaafe tammu kusheppe issi kushe izas immides. Koyro iza sunththaas birsheththi, «Xillo kawo» guussa. Kaallidi qasse, «Saaleme kawo» guussi, «Saroteththa kawo» guussa. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Izas aayakka, aawaykka woykko iza yeletaas zarkkeyka baa; izi ayde yelettidi ayde hayqqidaakko erettibeenna; izas doomeththinne wurseththi baa; gido attiin Xoossa naa mala mernaas izi qeese gididi dees.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Ane intte izi ay mala gitakko qopite, haray attoshin aawatas ubbaas koyroy Abrahaamey ba di7i ekkida ubbaafe tammaafe issaa kessi immides. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Isttas qeeseteththi imettida Lewe nayti istta ishati Abrahaame zereththata gidikkoka deraappe hessika ba ishatappe tammaafe issaa ekkana mala isttas wogan azazettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Tay 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Hayssa ha addeza zereththi Lewe zereth gidenna; gido attiin izi Abrahaameppe tammaafe issaa ekkides; kase izas hidota qaalay imettida Abrahaame anjjides. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Bayray kaalo anjjizayssi woga. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Issi baggara tammaafe issaa ekkizayti hayqqizayta; hara baggara qasse tammaafe issaa ekkizaadey hayqqontta paxa diza mala izas markkattidaadey Malkexeedeqe. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Haray attoshin Leweykka Abrahaame baggara tammaafe issaa kessides gaanaas dandayettees. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Gaasoykka Malkexeedeqey Abrahaamera gaaggiza wode Lewey buro ba aawaa Abrahaameppe yelettibeenna.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusi Malkexeedeqe Mala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Pacey baynda poloy beettidaynne wogay derezas imettiday Lewe qeeseteththaa mala gididaakko Aaroone mala gidontta Malkexeedeqe shuumeteththaa malay hara qeesey yaanaas aazas koshshidee? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Qeeseteththa zarkkey laamettiza wode wogaykka laamettanayssi attontta miishsha. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Hessi wurikka izas yootettida qeesey izi hara zereththa; iza zereththaafe oonikka yarshoson ooththi erizaadey baa. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Nu Goday Yuhuda baggafe yidayssi tuma; Musey qeeseta gishshas yootishe ha zereththaa gishshas yootidayssi issi miishshika deenna.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Malkexeedeqe malay hara qeesey dendiko nu kase yootida yo7oy daro qoncce gidenna. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Izi qeese gididay dhayontta de7o wolqqan attiin zereththafe yida wogaappe gidenna. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Izas, «Ne Malkexeedeqe shuumeteththaa mala mernaas qeese» gi markkattides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maza 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Kase azazoy laafanne go7onttayssa gidida gishshas attides. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Wogay oonakka geeshshanaas dandayontta gishshas nuni Xoossa ach shiiqanaas izappe aadhdhiza hara hidotay nuus imettides.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Hessika caaqoy baynda hanibeenna; hankko qeese gididayti caaqoy bayndayta. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Izi gidikko qeeseteththaa caaqon ekkides.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Gaasoykka Xoossi iza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">«Goday caaqqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">ba qofaa izi laammenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">‹Ne mernaas qeese› » gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maza 110:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Hessa mala caaqoppe dendidayssan Yesusi hessafe aadhdhiza caaqo qaalas waase gidides.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kase qeeseti ba ooson sinththe gujjontta mala hayqoy istta diggida gishshas qooday isttas daro. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Yesusi gidikko mernaas dizaade gidida gishshas iza qeeseteththi shaarettontta qeeseteththa. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Hessa gishshas izi istta giigsana gaannatishe ubba wode hayqqontta paxa eqqi diza gishshas iza baggara Xoossaako yizayta ubbaa ashshanaas dandayees. <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Hessa gishshas nuus koshshiza qeeseta halaqay hessa mala geeshshinne wosoy iza bolla baynda xillonne nagaranchchatappe shaakettidi salotappe bollara bonchchettida qeeseta halaqa. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Izi hankko qeeseta halaqata mala koyro ba nagaraa gishshas qasseka hankko dereza nagaraa gishshas gallas gallas yarsho shiishshanaas iza koshshenna; izi bana aaththi immida wode asa nagara gishshas issito sinththa baggassara yarsho wursi polides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lewe 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Wogay daaburanchcha asata qeesetas waanna halaqa histti shuumees. Wogappe kaallidi yida caaqo qaalay gidikko mernaas iza bolla wosoy baynda naaza shuumides.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ooraththa Caaqo Qeese Halaqa Yesusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Hessa gishshas nu ha7i ooththana waanna yo7oy hayssa; hayssa mala salo bolla Xoossa bonchcho alga ushachchan uttida qeeseta halaqay nuus dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maza 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Izi asi tokkida dunkaane giddon ooththizaade gidontta Godaa Xoossay tokkida tumu dunkaanen geeshshasohon ooththizaade.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Qeeseta halaqay shuumettizay asay Xoossas immizayssa Xoossas shiishshanaassinne yarsho yarshanaassa; hessa gishshas hayssi ha qeeseta halaqaykka Xoossas shiishshanaas issi shiishshiza miish izas koshshees. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Izi biitta bolla dizaakko qeese gidenna; aazas giikko wogay giza mala yarsho shiishshiza hara qeeseti deettes. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Istti kase salon diza Xoossa Keeththays leemisonne eesho; Musey dunkaaneza ooththana gishin, «Nees zuma bolla qonccidayssaththo wursa ooththanaas naagetta» giza azazoy hessa gishshas izas imettides. <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Gido attiin Yesusi giddo geli gaannatizay caaqo qaalay kaseyssafe aadhdhizayssa mala izi ekkida oosoykka kaseyta oosoppe aadhdhees; hessika kaseyssafe lo7iza hidota qaalanna.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Kase caaqo qaalaan pacey bayndaako nam7anththo hara caaqqanaas koshshenna. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Gido attiin Xoossi dereza bolla pacey dizayssa demmida gishshas, «Isra7eele asaaranne Yuhuda asaara tani ooraththa caaqo caaqettana wodey yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Er 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Hessika ta istta Gibxeppe kessanaas istta kushe oykkada kase istta aawatara caaqettida qaalaa mala gidenna; gaasoykka istti kase ta caaqo qaalaan eqqibeettenna; tanikka istta yedda bessadis.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />«Hessafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Isra7eele asaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ta caaqettana qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">hayssa mala gees Goday.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Tani ta wogaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">istta wozinan woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">istta wozina bollaka xaafana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Ta istta Xoos gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">isttika ta dere gidana.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Hayssafe guye asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ba guta asaa woykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ba ishaa, ‹Ne Godaa era›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">gi tamaarsenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">Gaasoykka asi guuththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">gitata gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">wurikka tana erana.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Istta qohoza ta maarana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">Hayssafe sinththan ta asa nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">nam7anththo zaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">qoppike» gees.<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Hayssa ha caaqoza izi, «Ooraththa Caaqo» giidi kase caaqoza gal7a kessides; hessa gishshas gal7idi wuridayssi dhayana wodey matides.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Biitta Bollanne Salon Diza Goyno Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Koyro caaqo qaalazan Xoossas goynniza wogaynne biitta bolla diza Xoossa Keeththi dees. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Kase nam7u kifilera diza dunkaaney giigetti dees; koyro kifilezan xomppe woththizasoynne xaraphpheezay qasse ukeththi dees; hessa he kifilezi dumma kifile geetettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kessa 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">26:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Nam7anththo kifilezi nam7anththo magalashaappe guye baggara diza kifiley ubbaafe dumma geetettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kessa 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Hessa giddon worqqafe oosettida exaane cuwasiza qeeri shel7e malaynne worqqan meeshettida caaqo qaala taabotay dees; he taabotaykka iza giddon mannay diza worqqa leematey, cililida Aaroone guufeynne caaqo qaalati iza bolla xaafettida masettida shuchchati deettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:33">Kessa 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Tay 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Zaare 10:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />He taabotaza bolla diza nagarappe maaroteththa kamaza bolla ba qefera kammiza bonchcho kirubeti deettes; ha7i qasse nu heytantta issaa issaa gishshas shaakki shaakki haasayanaas dandayokko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Kessa 25:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Wurikka hessaththo giigettidaappe guye qeeseti ba ooso polanaas dunkaanaas koyro kifile geleettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Tay 18:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Gidikkoka ubbaafe giddotiza kifile qeeseta halaqay xalla gelees; hessika layththan issito xalla gidishin izi ba nagara gishshassinne derey erontta ooththida nagaraa gishshas shiishshiza yarsho suuth oykkontta mulekka gelenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lewe 16:2-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Koyro dunkaanezi kase diza wode gede ubbaafe dumma geetettizaso efiza ogey he wode qoncce gidonttayssa Xillo Ayanay bessees. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Hessika hayssa ha wodezas leemiso gidishin kase shiiqiza yarshotinne coo imettiza imotati immizayta wozina shempisanaassinne mule geeshshanaas dandaybeettenna. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Heytantti wurikka ooraththa wogay yaana gakkanaas coo mela doona haasaya mala; qasseka istti muussa gishshassinne ushsha gishshas qasseka dumma dumma geesho wogata xalla.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosa Suuth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Gidikkoka Kirstoosi buroppe yaanaas diza lo7o miishshatas qeeseta halaqa gididi qonccides; izi izan gelida dunkaanezi gitanne geeshsha; he dunkaanezi asa kushen oosettonttayssanne hayssa ha medheteththaafe gidenna. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Izi he dunkaanezan gelishe deyshata suuththinne wofano boorata suuth ekki gelibeenna; gido attiin as ashshanaas mernaas ba suuth ekkidi ubbaafe dumma geetettiza kifileza hara wode nam7anththo gelontta mala wurseththa gelo gelides. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Isttas kare bagga asateththay tunida asata bolla araciza deysha suuththinne wofano boorata suuththi hessaththoka yarshos xuugettida ussaa bidinththi istta geeshshizayssa gidikko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Lewe 16:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Tay 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />mernaa Ayanan bana wosoy baynda yarsho ooththi Xoossas shiishshida Kirstoosa suuththi nuni de7o Xoossaas goynnanaas hayqeththa oosoppe nuna ay mala aaththi geeshshandee?<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Hessa gishshas xeygettidayti isttas immana geetettida mernaa laata ekkana mala Kirstoosi ooraththa caaqos gaannatizaade gidides; koyro caaqoza garsan diza wode istti ooththida nagarappe geeyana mala istta gishshas izi hayqqides.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Bazay bazettizayssa gidikko bazidaade hayqo shaakki eranaas bessees. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Gaasoykka bazay minnizay bazidaadey hayqqiinna. Bazidaadey paxa dishin bazay aykkoka ooththenna.<verse eid="HEB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Hessa gishshas koyro caaqo qaalay suuththi baynda minnibeenna. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Musey ba azazo wogaa deraas yooti simmidi deyshata suuththinne wofano boorata suuth haaththara ekkidi zo7o dorsa isken ecere wurce misatiza hisophphe geetettiza miththara ekkidi ba xaafida wogaa maxaafa bollaninne dereza bolla wuxxides. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />«Intte naagana mala inttena Xoossi azazida caaqo qaala suuththay hayssa» gides. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Hessaththoka dunkaanezanne iza giddon diza ooso miishshaa ubbaa bolla suuth wuxxides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lewe 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Addafekka guuththa miishshati attishin hankko daro miishshay suuththan geeyanaas bessizayssa wogay azazees; suuththi gukkontta dishin maaroy baa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lewe 17:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Hessa gishshas salo miishshatas leemiso gididayti haytanttan geeyanayssi attenna shin; Salon diza miishshati gidikko hayssafekka aadhdhiza yarshon geeyanaas bessees. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kirstoosi tumu dunkaaneys leemisonne asa kushen oosettida Xoossa Keeththe gelibeenna; gido attiin ha7i nu gishshas Xoossa sinththan beettanaas pude salo gelides. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Qeeseta halaqay ba suuth gidontta suuth ekkidi layththan layththan ubbaafe dumma kifile gelizayssaththo Kirstoosi bana yarshanaas pude salo shiretti shiretti gelibeenna. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Hessa mala gidizaakko Kirstoosi alamey medhettoosoppe haa simmiin daro wode meto ekkanaas bessees; ha7i qasse wode wurseththan bana yarshidi nagara digganaas wurseththas issito qonccides.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Hessaththoka asi issito hayqqees; hessafe kaallidi pirda sinththan eqqanaas giigi uttides. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Kirstoosi daro asa nagara digganaas issito yarshettides; nam7anththoka izi qonccana; hessi iza naagizaytas atoteth ekki yaanaas attiin nam7anththo zaari nagara tookkanaas gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosi Issito Mernaas Shiishshida Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Muse wogay buro sinththara yaana lo7o hanotas eeshoppe attiin tumu adda medhay izas deenna; hessa gishshas layththan layththan pacey baynda shiri shiri shiishshiza yarshoy Xoos goynnanaas shiiqiza asaa geeshshanaas mulekka dandaybeenna. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />As mulera geeshshana dandayzayssa gididaakko istti yarsho yarshanayssa aggettenee? Qasseka Xoos goynnana shiiqiza asay issito geeyzaakko ba wozinara nagaranchcha gididayssa sidhana. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Gido attiin heyti yarshoti layththan layththan nagara zaari zaari qofseettes. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Gaasoykka wofanotanne deyshata suuththi asappe nagara digganaas dandayenna.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Hessa gishshas Kirstoosi hayssa ha alameza yiidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«Neni imotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">yarsho koyabeekka shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">ne taas asho giigsadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Maza 40:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Taman xuugettiza yarshonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nagara gishshas shiiqiza yarshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">ufayettabeekka» gides.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />He wode tani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">«Ta gishshas Geeshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Maxaafan xaafettida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">‹Xoossoo, hekko tani ne shene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ooththanaas yadis› » gadis.<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Muse wogay hessi hessaththo hanana mala azazikkoka izi qasse koyro, «Yarsho, imota, xuugettiza yarshonne nagara gishshas shiiqiza yarsho ne koyabeekkanne izan ufayettabeekka» gees. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Kaaleththidikka, «Hekko ta ne shene ooththana yadis» gides. Nam7anththoza essanaas koyroyssa diggides. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Hayssan, «Iza shene» giza qaalaa mala hara yarsho zaareth shiishshanaas koshshontta mala Yesus Kirstoosa baggara issito shiiqida yarshon geeyidos.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Qeesey hach hach eqqidi ba ooso polees; as nagarappe geeshshanaas dandayonttayta wontiin wontiin shiishshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kessa 29:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Kirstoosi gidikko yarsho issito mernaas gidanayssa shiishshidi Aawaa ushachchan uttides. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />He gallassafe simmiin iza morkketi iza toho garsan yedhettana gakkanaas naagon dees. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Gaasoykka issito shiishshida yarshon geeyana asata mernaas geeshshides.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Hessa he hanoza gishshas Xillo Ayanaykka nuus markkattees. Goday koyro,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />«Hessafe guye ta isttara gelana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">caaqo qaalay hayssa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">Ta wogaa ta istta wozinan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">istta wozinan ta xaafana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Er 31:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Qasseka, «Ta istta nagaraanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">makkallaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">nam7anththo qoppike»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">gees Goday.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Er 31:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Heytantti wurikka atto geetettidaappe guye nam7anththo nagaras shiiqana hara yarshoy deenna.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseth Gakkanaas Minni Daana Mala Shiiqida Xeys</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Nuni Yesus Kirstoosa suuththaa baggara gede ubbaafe dumma geesh geetettizasoyo gelanaas xalateth demmidos. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Hessika magalasha baggara; izi ba asho baggara nuus doyda ooraththinne de7o gidida ogenna. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Xoossa Keeththa bolla shuumettida qeeseta halaqay nuus diza gishshas, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />nuni nu iita qofaappe geeyanaas nu wozina aracettidi nu asateththaaka xillo haaththan meecettidi tumu wozinappenne kumeththa ammanon Xoossaako ane shiiqoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lewe 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Hizi 36:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Nuus hidota qaalaa immidaadey ammanettizaade gidida gishshas nuni ammanidi iza gishshas markkattiza hidotappe yaanne haa gontta ane lo7eththi oykkoos. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Siiqoninne lo7o ooson nu minni daana mala ane issoy issaa qofsoos. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Ane nu ubba gallas issoy issaara gakki gakki issoy issaa minththeththoos attiin issi issi asati shiiqo aggida mala ane nuni shiiqoza aggoko; harappeka Godaa Yesusi matattidayssa qoppishe kaseppe minni shiiqite.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Nuni tumaa shaakki eridi ekkidayssafe guye erishe nagara ooththiko hayssafe guye nagara gishshas shiiqanaas hara yarshoy deenna. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Haray buro hanana daro babisiza pirday Xoossa morkketa xuuggana naagiza mino tamay xalla dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Muse wogaa kadhida asi nam7u woykko heedzdzu markkati markkattiko maaroy baynda hayqon qaxxayettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:5-7">Zaare 17:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Histtiin Xoossa naa kadhida asi izan geeyida caaqo suuththaa hiraysso miishsha mala qoodidaadessinne iza kiyateththaa Ayana iiseththidaades ay mala hessafe aadhdhiza pirday izas bessizaa inttes misatizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kessa 24:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />«Tani izas halo kessana; izaade ooso mala izaades ta zaarana» gidayssa nu eroos. Qasseka, «Goday ba dereza bolla pirdana» gees Goday.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">Zaare 32:35-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />De7o Xoossaa kushen kundeththi daro babisees.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Inttes issito poo7oy poo7idaappe guye meto wode daro baaxen intte kase minni eqqida beni wodeza yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Issi issi wode intte dere duulata sinththan cashshassinne goodeteththas aadhdhi imettideta; qasse hara wodekka hessa mala waayey istta bolla gakkida asatara intteka issife waaye beyideta. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Intte inttes harappe aadhdhiza mernaas daana haaroy dizayssa eriza gishshas qashettidaytas mishettidetanne intte haaroy bonqqettishin ufayssan dandaydeta.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Hessa gishshas gita waagay diza kase intte ammaneteththaa aggofte. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Intte Xoossa shene polidi izi inttes immida ufayssa qaalaa ekkanaas minni eqqanaas inttena koshshees. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Gaasoykka guuththa wodeppe kaallidi, «Yaanayssi izi yaana; gam7enna;» <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />xillo asi gidikko ammanon de7o demmana; guye undudizaadey diikko ta shemppoya izaade bolla ufayettuku.<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />«Nuni gidikko ammanidi attidayta bagga attiin gede guye undudi dhayzayta bagga gidokko» gides.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Ammano geeththi issi miishshe hanana giidi nu sidhontta dishe be7ontta miishsheka be7ida mala ero gi eko. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Kase Aawati galatettiday hessa mala ammanonna.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Hayssi ha alamey Xoossa qaalan medhettidayssa nuni ammanon eroos; hessaththoka ayfen beettizayssi medhettiday beettiza miishshafe gidonttayssa nuni eroos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Medhe 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6-9">Maza 33:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yoha 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Aabeeli Xoossas Qayeele yarshofe aadhdhiza yarsho ammanon shiishshides; Xoossi iza yarshoza gishshas haasayshe izi ammanon geesh gididayssa markkattides; izi hayqqiinka iza ammanoy ha7i gakkanaas haasayettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Medhe 4:3-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Heenookey hayqo be7ontta mala hayssa alamezappe ammanon ekettides; Xoossi iza ekkida gishshas izi beettibeenna; ekettanaappe kasetidi izi Xoossaa ufayssidayssi yootettida gishshas izi ekettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Medhe 5:21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Qasseka ammanoy baynda dishin Xoossaa ufayssanaas mulekka dandayettenna; gaasoykka Xoossaako shiiqizaadey wurikka Xoossi gizayssanne wozinappe iza koyzaytas izi waaga immanayssa ammananaas bessees.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Nohes Xoossi buro Nohey ba ayfen be7ontta miishshaa gishshas naagettana mala yootiin Nohey Xoossas babbidi baso asa ashshanaas ammanon markabe keexxidi alame asaa pirdisides; ammanon beettiza xilloteth laattizaade gidides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Medhe 6:13-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Abrahaamey baas laata biitta ekkanaas xeygettida wode ammanon azazettides; awa bizaakko erontta aggikokka ero giidi bides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Medhe 12:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Allaga biittaan bete asa mala buro nees imettana geetettida biittaan ammanon uttides; izas imettida hidota qaalaa izara issife laattana Yisaaqa malanne Yaaqoobe mala dunkaanen de7ides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Medhe 35:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Gaasoykka minna dizaaro Xoossi izo qoppi medhdhida katamayo ekkana naagides.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Abrahaames wodey gede bidaade gidikkoka Saaraykka yelontta maynne gidikkoka hidota isttas immidaadey ammanettidaade histti xeellidi ammanon naa aawaa gidanaas gakkides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Medhe 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Hessa gishshas hayssa hayqqida asa mala qoodettida issi Abrahaameppe salo xoolintte malanne abba ace mala qooday baynda daro zereththay beettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Heyti wurikka isttas imettida hidota qaalaa demmontta ba ammanon naagida mala hayqqida; gidikkoka istti hayssa biittaa bolla imaththenne bete as gididayssa erida gishshas haahon dishe be7idi kushen aaththida mala ufayssan ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Medhe 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Taari 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Maza 39:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Hessa mala giza asati istta derey awakkonne ba dere naagizayssa qonccen besseettes. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Istti ba yeggi kezida dere zaari qoppizaakko guye simmi baana dandayeettes. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ha7i hessafe aadhdhiza pude salon diza dere laamoteettes; hessa gishshas Xoossi isttas salon katama giigsida gishshas, «Istta Xoossaa» geetetti xeygettanaas yeellatibeenna.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Xoossi Abrahaamey ba naaza Yisaaqa shukkana mala paacciin Abrahaamey Yisaaqa yarshanaas ammanon shiishshides; Xoossi izas immana gidayssa izikka ba naa issineza shukkanaas giigettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Medhe 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Hessika Xoossi izas «Ne zereththi Yisaaqa baggara xeygettana» gidayssa mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe 21:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Xoossi hayqqidaade denththanaas dandayzayssa Abrahaamey ammanida gishshas Yisaaqakka hayqoppe dendida asa mala nam7anththo demmides. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Yisaaqay buroppe hananayssa qoppi ekkidi Yaaqoobenne Eesawe ammanon anjjides.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Yaaqoobey hayqqana gishshas Yooseefe nayta issaa issaa ammanon anjjidaynne ba guufe bolla dartti eqqidi goynniday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:31">Medhe 47:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">48:1-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Yooseefey hayqqana gishshas Isra7eele asay Gibxeppe kezanayssa izi yootidaynne ba meqeththaa gishshas istti ay ooththanaakko istta azaziday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24">Medhe 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kessa 13:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Musey yelettiin izas malay lo7o gididayssa be7idi iza yelidayti iza heedzdzu agina gakkanaas kawoza azazo babbontta qottiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kessa 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">1:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Musey dicci gakkidi, «Paaroones nay naa» geetettanayssa ammanon ixxides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Kessa 2:10-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Guuththa wodes nagaran beettiza ufayssafe aaththidi Xoossa asaara meto beyanaas doorides. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Gibxe deren diza haaroppe bollara Kirstoosa gishshas waaye ekoy daro aadhdhiza haaro gididayssa yuushshi qoppides; gaasoykka izi sinththafe ekkanayssa buro haahon be7ida gishshassa.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kawoza hanqos babbontta ammanon Gibxe yeggi kezides; buro beettonttayssa be7iza mala qoppidi he qofaan minni eqqides. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Bayrata ubbaa wodhizayssi Isra7eeleta bayra nayta wodhontta mala ammanon Paaziganne suuththa wuxeththa woga woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Kessa 12:21-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Isra7eele asay mela biitta bolla hemettiza mala Zo7o abbaa giddora ammanon pinnides; Gibxe asay qasse isttaththo hanana gishe abbaan mitettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Kessa 14:21-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Isra7eele asay Iyarkko gimbeza laappun qamma yuuyi yuuyi aadhdhidaappe guye gimbeza ammanon laallides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Iya 6:12-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Layman aqiza Era7aaba dere xomosana yidayta saron mokka ekkida gishshas hankko azazettontta asaara dhayontta ammanon attadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya 2:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:21-25">6:21-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Hayssafe aadheth hara ay gaanee? Geedoone gishshas, Baraaqe gishshas, Samsoone gishshas, Yoftahe gishshas, Dawite gishshas, Sameela gishshas qasse nabeta gishshas ta yootontta mala taas wodey deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Daanna 6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13:2—16:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11:1—12:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1">1Same 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1Kawo 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Heytantti ammanon kawota xoonida; suure pirda pirdida; baas imettida hidota qaalaa ekkida; gaammota doona gordida;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Daane 6:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />tama wolqqa toyssida; qara mashshafe kessi ekki attida; daaburappe minnida; olason goobata gidida; allaga asaa ola gooddida;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:21-30">Daane 3:21-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />maccassatas hayqqidayti paxida; baggayti qasse hessafe aadhdhiza hayqoppe denth demmanaas giidi hayqoppe ateth leqqidi hayqos bana aaththi immida; waayeppe attanaas koyibeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Kawo 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Kawo 4:25-37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Issi issi asati asan kaa7ettida; garafettida; baggayti qasse qasho keeth gelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1Kawo 22:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2Taari 18:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Er 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15-16">37:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Shuchchan cadettida; magaazenkka nam7u kezi phalqettida; mashshan shuketti hayqqida; goodettishenne daaburshe dorsa itenne deysha ite may7idi waayettida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Taari 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Ha alamey isttas bessonttayssa gidida gishshas bazzoninne gezzen gongoloninne olla giddon waayettida.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Heytantta ubbata ammano gishshas markkattikokka isttafe oonikka imettana geetettida hidota qaalaa gakki ekkidaadey deenna. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Xoossi nuus hessafe aadhdhizaaz giigsida gishshas nu baynda istti xalla kumeth gidana dandaybeettenna.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Ba Nayta Seerees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Hessa gishshas shaara mala nuna yuuyi aadhdhida daro markkati nuus dishin nuna deexxiza toohonne qasse nuna qachchi oykkiza nagara wursi nuuppe wora yeggidi nu sinththan diza woththaa genccaninne dandayan ane woxxoos. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Nu ammaniza ammanozas koyronne polo gidida Yesusa ane xeelloos; izi ba sinththan diza ufayssaa gishshas masqale bolla hayqo dandaydi masqale bolla bana gakkana kawushshateththaa leqqidi Xoossa algaas ushachchan uttides.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Histtiko intte daaburdi hidota qanxxontta mala hessaththoka nagaranchchatappe kase iza bolla gakkida hessa mala eqeteth dandayda Yesusa qopite. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Suuththi gukkana gakkanaas nagarara intte buro eqettibeekketa. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Intte Xoossa nayta gidi uttidi qaalay gizayssa balideta; «Ta naazoo Xoossa seera kawushshan xeellofa; nena izi seeriza wode hidota qanxxofa. <verse eid="HEB 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Gaasoykka Goday ba dosizaade hanqees; izi ba dosizaade seerees; izi ba naa mala xeellizaade qaxxayees» gides.<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Xoossi inttena ba naa mala qoodiza gishshas hanqo dandayte; aaway hanqontta nay oonee? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Nay wuri seeran dicciza mala intte diccontta aggiko intte karen yelettida naa attiin soo naa gidekketa. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Hessa ubbaafe bollara hayssa biitta bolla nuna hanqi dichchida asho aawati deettes; nunikka istta bonchchoos; histtiin de7on deyanaas nuus Ayana Aawaa gididayssas aazas hessafe aaththi azazettokonii? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Nu aawati nuna baas lo7o misati beettida mala guuththa wodes qaxxayeettes; Xoossi gidikko nuni iza geeshshateththaa izappe demmana mala nuna go7anaas qaxxayees. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Qixaatey wurikka ha7is ufayssontta iita misatees shin guyeppe qasse dosi ekkida asatas saroteththi izan kumida xilloteththa ayfen gaththees.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Hessa gishshas daaburda intte qesenne intte gulbate minththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:3">Isa 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Wobbey paxana mala attiin kaseppe aaththi wobbontta mala intte tohos lo7o oge giigsite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Leemi 4:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Azazettonttaades Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Asi ubbara saro daana mala inttes dandayettizayssa ubbaa ooththite; geeyana mala koyite; geeshshateththi baynda Godaa beyanaas dandayettenna. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Inttefe issaadeska Xoossa kiyateththi paccontta mala qasseka camo ayfe ayfiza miththi mokkidi meto medhdhontta malanne darota moorontta mala naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Zaare 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Issito maana kaththas ba bayrateth bayzida Eesawe mala inttefe oonikka laymatizaade woykko Xoos bonchchonttaade gidi beettontta mala naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Medhe 25:29-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Eesawey guyeppe kase ba anjjoza laattanaas zaari koyiin izas imettontta digettidayssa intte ereeta; izi bana gakkiza anjjozaska daro yeekkishe koyidikka zaari demmanaas dandaybeenna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Demmanaas dandaybeenna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Demmanaas dandaybeenna gizayssa maarettanaas aykko qaada demmibeenna gaana dandayettees.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Medhe 27:30-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Kushen bochchiko boshettiza tamay iza bolla eexxiza Siina zumaakko, he dhumaakko, he tulalazaakkonne he gote carkozaakko intte gakkibeekketa. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Intte zaye giirissaako woykko hayththan siyettiza qaala giirissaako gakkibeekketa; hessa siyida asatikka hara qaala gujjontta mala woossida. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Hessas gaasoykka, «Haray attoshin meheykka zuma bochchizaa gidikko shuchchan cadetti hayqo» giza azazoza asay naaganaas dandaybeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Kessa 19:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />He wode heen hanizayssi wurikka daro babisizayssa gidida gishshas Museykka, «Ta babbada kokkoradis» gides.<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Intte qasse ha Xiyoone zumaa bolla, pude salo Yerusalaame, de7o Xoossaa katama ufayssan shiiqida qooday baynda kiitanchchatakko yideta. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Istta sunththi salon xaafettida bayrata maabarankko; ubbaas daanna gidida Xoossaako istta bolla wosoy baynda xillo asata shemppoy dizaso matideta. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Ooraththa caaqon maqayinththizay Yesusaakko; hessaththoka Aabeeli shiishshida suuththaafe aadhdhiza caaqo qaala yootiza aracettida suuththaako gakkideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Medhe 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Inttes yootizayssa intte akkay gontta mala naagettite; heytantti Xoossi biitta bolla diza asa baggara isttas yootizayssa ekkontta ixxidi izappe attanaas dandayontta aggiko nuni saloppe yidayssi nuus yootishin ekkontta ixxiko nu izappe waani attanee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Kessa 20:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />He wode qaala giirissan biitta qaaththides; «Ha7i qasse biitta xalla gidontta tani salokka qasseka ta zaarada issito qaaththana» giza qaala yooti woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hagge 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Hayssi, «Qasseka ta zaarada issito» giza qaalay nuna bessizay qaaxxonttayti minni daana malanne qaaxxizayti heytikka medhettidayti kichchanayssa bessees.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Hessa gishshas nuni mulekka qaaxxontta kawoteth laattana gishshas ane Xoos galatoos; qasseka iza ufayssiza ogera bonchchoossinne yashshateththan ane izas goynnoos. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Nu Xoossay xuuggiza tama mala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Zaare 4:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Intte intte giddon ishata mala dosettite. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Imaththa moko balopite; issi issi asati hessaththo ooththishe erontta kiitanchchata imaththateth mokki ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Medhe 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Qasho keeththan dizaytara intteka qashettida mala isttas qopite; hessaththoka asa kushen waayettizaytara intteka waayettiza mala isttas qopite.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ekoy geloy ubba asaa achchan bonchchetto; intte hiiththi geesh gido; gaasoykka layma amoy dizayta bollanne laymatizayta bolla Xoossi pirdana.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Miishsha siiqoppe naagettite; inttes dizayssi gidana; hessas gaasoykka Xoossi, «Ta inttena mulekka aggikenne yeggike» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Zaare 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Hessa gishshas kumeththa wozinappe nuni, «Goday taas maado; ta babbike; tana asi ay ooththana dandayzee?» goos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Maza 118:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Inttes Xoossa qaala koyroppe yooti kaaleththizayta balopite; istta duussan beettiza lo7o ayfey dizayssa yuushshi qopite; intteka ammanon istta misatite. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesus Kirstoosi hachchika wontoka mernaaskka izi izakko! <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Dumma dumma imaththa timirte ekkofte; nu wozinay minni eqqizay Xoossa kiyateththan attiin kaththa wogaa naagon gidenna; he woga naagizaytikka izan go7ettibeettenna.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Nuus yarshosoy dees; gidikkoka dunkaaneza giddon ooththiza qeeseti he yarshosoza bolla diza kaththaafe ekki montta mala digettida. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Qeeseta halaqay nagara teqqiza mehe suuth ekkidi ubbaafe dumma geetettiza kifile gelees; meheta ashoy gidikko katamappe karen xuugettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lewe 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Hessaththoka Yesusi ba suuththaa baggara asaa geeshshanaas katama pengefe karen meto be7ides.<verse eid="HEB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Hessa gishshas nunikka izi tookkidi kawushshateththaa tookkidi nu dizasoppe gede izakko kare ane kezoos. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Gaasoykka hayssan eqqi daana katamay nuus deenna; gido attiin buro sinththafe yaana katamayo naagoos. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Hessa gishshas ubba wode galata yarsho hessika iza sunththaas markkattiza nu doonappe beettiza ayfe gididaaz Yesusa baggara Xoossas ane shiishshoos. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Qasseka lo7o oosonne inttes dizayssafe haratas imo balopite; Xoossi heytantta mala yarshon ufayettees.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Inttena kaaleththizaytas azazettitenne haarettite; hessas gaasoykka intte gishshas istta alaafeteththan daro oychchiza gudday diza gishshas intte shemppo gishshas daro baaxeteettes; hessa gishshas istti ba ooththiza oosoza lancettishe gidontta ufayssan ooththana mala intte isttas azazettite. Intte hessaththo histtontta aggiko inttes lo7enna. <verse eid="HEB 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Nuuska woossite; Ubbasorakka lo7o duus daanaas laamotiza lo7o qofay nuus dizayssa nu sidhokko. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Harappeka ta intteko ellen simma baana mala taas intte woossana mala hadara gays.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Dorsata heenththanchchay wogga Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa ba mernaa caaqo qaala suuththan iza hayqoppe denththida saroteththa Xoossi, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />intte iza shene polana mala lo7eteththan inttena gixiso; Xoossa ufayssizayssa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nunan ooththo; izas mernaappe mernaas bonchchoy gido. Amiin. <verse eid="HEB 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ta ishatoo! Inttes xaafida zore qaalay guuth gidida gishshas intte hanqettontta mala ta inttena hadara gays. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Nu ishaa Ximtoosi birshettidayssa intte erana mala ta koyays; izi eeson taakko yiikko ta izara hee baada inttena heen beyana.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Inttena kaaleththizayta ubbatassinne ammaniza asaa ubbaas ta saroka yootite. Ixaaliyan diza ammaniza asaykka inttena saro gees. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido. Amiin.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>